From 05040f762c62b3d457be12fe2d40084fb86219d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nx789j-port <port@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:54:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support REDMAGIC 10 Pro / 10S Pro (NX789J) on Android 15 and
 16

Add CompatibilityPolicy.isSupportedDevice (NX809J or NX789J*, any region
suffix) and isSupportedSdk (35 or 36) and route every runtime gate through
them: dashboard, editors, pickers, boot-resume receiver, guard broker and
the Vector module entry. The original isNx809j() is kept unchanged.

classify() uses the new gates so the dashboard status is meaningful on the
10 Pro. Device card shows the real Build.MODEL and Android version.
Policy tests keep their intent using NX769J / SDK 34 as the unsupported
samples. No hook or backend logic changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YH5G3LuW1VfTWVDHa5dyUt
